---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer
  class="bg-surface-background-alt border-t border-border"
  role="contentinfo"
  aria-label="Site footer"
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16 space-y-10">
    <div class="space-y-4 text-sm text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
      <p>
        Bible is an open public development handbook maintained by <strong>Igor Osipov</strong>.
      </p>
      <p>
        Canonical source: <a href="https://github.com/nicolapitersky/Bible" class="text-text-primary hover:text-text-secondary transition duration-fast">GitHub</a><br />
        Public mirror: <a href="https://www.osipov.uk/Bible" class="text-text-primary hover:text-text-secondary transition duration-fast">www.osipov.uk/Bible</a>
      </p>
      <p>
        Free to use and reuse under the <a href="https://github.com/nicolapitersky/Bible/blob/main/LICENSE" class="text-text-primary hover:text-text-secondary transition duration-fast">MIT License</a>.
      </p>
      <p>
        If you build on Bible, please reference the original project where appropriate.<br />
        Forks, derivatives, and services must not imply official status or endorsement without permission.
      </p>
      <p class="text-xs text-text-tertiary">
        Contact: <a href="mailto:support@osipov.uk" class="text-text-primary hover:text-text-secondary transition duration-fast">support@osipov.uk</a> ·
        <a href="https://www.osipov.uk" class="text-text-primary hover:text-text-secondary transition duration-fast">osipov.uk</a> ·
        <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/igorosipov/" class="text-text-primary hover:text-text-secondary transition duration-fast">LinkedIn</a>
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="border-t border-border pt-6 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row sm:justify-between sm:items-center text-xs text-text-tertiary">
      <p>&copy; {year} Igor Osipov. All rights reserved.</p>
      <p>
        Built with
        <a
          href="https://astro.build"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="text-text-primary hover:text-text-secondary transition duration-fast"
        >
          Astro
        </a>
        &mdash; Lighthouse score 100.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
